# Maine CyberTech Portal Code Owners
#
# Branch protection requires a CODEOWNERS review (require_code_owner_reviews),
# so every team handle here must resolve to a real org team — a typo silently
# drops the owner for that path and the review requirement stops applying.
# `scripts/check-codeowners.mjs` (run by the shared unit-tests gate with a
# fixture self-test in `scripts/ci/check-codeowners.sh`) validates the syntax
# and, when CODEOWNERS_READ_TOKEN is set (fine-grained PAT with Organization →
# Members: read), resolves every team via the GitHub API. Each referenced team
# must have at least one member with write access; see docs/CI.md
# ("CODEOWNERS enforcement", BP-P3-005).

# Repository root
* @mainecybertech/leads

# API backend
/apps/api/ @mainecybertech/backend

